(
a1 OR a2 OR a3 . . . ) AND (b1 OR b2 OR b3 . . . ), where a1 OR a2 OR a3 ... are
translations terms for original query term a and b1 OR b2 OR b3 . . . are translation
terms for term b. If no translation result is found in the dictionary, query term will
