2 false negative are detected. This false negative rate maybe not be low enough to
be negligible, but considering the simpleness of the rule, this is an relatively e↵ective
way to do the converting. Using this rule, we can identify meaningless uppercase
words introduced by translation API. For example “The live video” will be converted
